    "hormone_review_th9XCh": {
      "type": "hormone-review",
      "blocks": {
        "reviews_CYq3Uh": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "title": "<p><strong>Good, Affordable test kit</strong></p>",
            "dsc": "<p>The testing kit arrived quickly — within 2–3 days of purchase, which was impressive. It’s also more affordable than most other online blood test options I’ve found. The instructions were clear, the process was simple, and everything you need is included. Great option if you want to check your hormone levels conveniently from home. Sometimes, I had to contact the company directly to retrieve my results, as I didn’t receive them automatically as expected. But overall I would recommend</p>",
            "name": "H. Ramachandra",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_mVeqRb": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "",
            "title": "<p><strong>Next level!</strong></p>",
            "dsc": "<p>...I followed the instructions, stuck the device to my arm and pressed the button, I didn't feel anything and couldn't see anything happening (no blood) so I assumed it was all a waste of time and money! I glanced back at the blood tube and it was almost full! I couldn't believe it!? Well done Randox, 5 stars!</p>",
            "name": "G. Matthews",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_8cFH8b": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "",
            "title": "<p><strong>Good!</strong></p>",
            "dsc": "<p>I'm just finishing my second month and I can only say that my symptoms have reduced dramatically. After quitting my birth control pills, my pain got back and i needed to take painkillers all the time. To be honest, i completely lost the faith that something else could help. I can only say, very worth the price. Thanks monthlies for bringing my life back!</p>",
            "name": "Kunde",
            "age": ""
          }
        },
        "reviews_Pgj6qt": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "settings": {
            "rating": "5",
            "title": "<p><strong>Affordable Kit</strong></p>",
            "dsc": "<p>My period has now started and it has been the least painful and least messy one I've had in years - I had no pms symptoms to the point I was wondering if my period was even coming! I had some very mild cramping, that was only noticeable because I wasn't doing anything and then took half an aspirin the next day for a little bit of a backache. I'm very happy right now. </p>",
            "name": "Victoria",
            "age": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "reviews_CYq3Uh",
        "reviews_mVeqRb",
